      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Just in case, for anyone affected: Make sure you have no third-party applications running that could interfere with VRChat's cache functionality. Especially VRCX has caused issues before during this beta. Make sure VRCX is fully closed and then run VRChat again. If you still encounter this issue, try clearing your cache. If you _still_ encounter the issue - please post a log file so we can further investigate.",
