      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "A few observations:\n\n- Sometimes they will eventually load in as error robots after being stuck as loading diamonds for a while.\n\n- I have had this happen to even my own avatar, if left long enough it turns into an error robot. No amount of changing in and out of the avatar or rejoining will fix it, I just have to use a different avatar.\n\n- I have also seen this happen to other people’s avatars, no amount of hiding/showing will fix it, I just have to ask them to use a different avatar. \n\n- I don’t use vrcx, never have.\n\n- for me it only started happening after the second beta (1547)\n\n- Clearing my cache seems to have fixed it.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
